<mxCell id="t31" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="PermissionDenied raised inside a route -&amp;gt; templates/handlers/403.html&lt;br&gt;Missing permission on @require_permission -&amp;gt; 403 page (staff) or redirect to login (anonymous)&lt;br&gt;Blocking maintenance -&amp;gt; 503 + Retry-After, unless the user holds admin.maintenance.bypass&lt;br&gt;Engine is None (env vars unset) -&amp;gt; feature degrades, page still renders; reporting RO engines -&amp;gt; 503&lt;br&gt;Unhandled exception -&amp;gt; 500 handler, stack in var/logs/system/app.log&lt;br&gt;Talisman CSP is PROD-only: inline onclick= works on INT and is silently refused on PROD (lint test guards it)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="490" width="960" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b32" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;dashed=1;spacingTop=2;" value="Caches you should know about" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="460" width="1000" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t33" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="user_cache.py  - permissions + ui_prefs per user, 30 s (NEXORA_USER_CACHE_TTL), invalidated on the user&#x27;s own writes&lt;br&gt;mapping_config.py  - ProcessSources / FieldMappings / Labels / Aliases registry, 60 s&lt;br&gt;branding.py  - organization accent + logo, 60 s&lt;br&gt;tenant/registry.py  - tenants, pages, entities, invalidated by the admin routes&lt;br&gt;maintenance.py  - blocking banner lookup, 5 s&lt;br&gt;clients.py  - dbo.Clients -&amp;gt; engines, built ONCE at import (needs app-pool recycle)&lt;br&gt;workitem_sources.py  - per-(client,id) probe result cache, detail routes take ?client=&amp;lt;code&amp;gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="490" width="960" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="3 Code layout" id="3_Code_layout"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="700" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2200" pageHeight="1200" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="t1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" value="Repository layout - what lives where" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1400" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
