<mxCell id="t10" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&amp;lt;area&amp;gt;[.&amp;lt;object&amp;gt;[.&amp;lt;sub&amp;gt;]].&amp;lt;action&amp;gt;[.&amp;lt;scope&amp;gt;]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;areas:   admin  workitems  dashboard  reporting  process  tenant  api  jd&lt;br&gt;actions: view add edit delete use run export schedule manage bypass import restart&lt;br&gt;scopes:  (none = own records)  org  all  pastdeadline&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;area&amp;gt;.view is the landing page and greys out everything beneath it in the grid (UI hint only - the server checks each code).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dynamic families minted at runtime:&lt;br&gt;  process.&amp;lt;client&amp;gt;.&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;.view      by /admin/processes (granted to nobody)&lt;br&gt;  reporting.source.&amp;lt;code&amp;gt;.use       by dbo.ReportingSources.Permission&lt;br&gt;  tenant.&amp;lt;code&amp;gt;.view / .edit / ...  by the tenant kernel&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Regex: PERMISSION_CODE_RE in nx_lib/security.py" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="130" width="660" height="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
